description "Staged bootc auto-update timer"

supports "fedora"

// Fetching updates on a timer without verifying them is the one
// combination that must not be buildable, so the signature policy is a
// declared requirement rather than something that happens to be listed
// nearby. Delisting core/signature-policy now fails lint here instead of
// producing an image that pulls unverified updates unattended.
requires "signature-policy"
